# The Express backend. Production: https://backend.drinksharbour.com
#
# A LOCAL address (localhost, 127.x, 10.x, 192.168.x, 172.16-31.x) means "the dev
# machine, on this port": lib/api-base-url.ts replaces the host with the address
# Expo serves the bundle from, so the same value works on a simulator and on a
# physical device. Only the PORT matters. A public https URL is used as-is.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5001
